OL,3,GNEWSAMan sentenced for 'eye-wateringly
OL,4,Aviolent' killing of dog
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man who hit his dog on the head with
OL,7,Fa hammer and stabbed her in the chest
OL,8,Fhas been banned from owning or keeping
OL,9,Fanimals for the rest of his life.
OL,11,FGlenn Tweedie pleaded guilty at
OL,12,FEdinburgh Sheriff Court to causing
OL,13,Funnecessary suffering to the black
OL,14,FLabrador, named Caillie, who died of
OL,15,Fher injuries.
OL,17,FThe Scottish SPCA were first alerted
OL,18,Fafter their animal helpline received a
OL,19,Fconcerned call about a dog 'screaming'
OL,20,Fat a property in Loanhead, Midlothian.
